<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Temptation</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Johnny Orlando</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Temptation</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1b06eJO4ZMbVoZl5LqyIrr</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">7 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Temptation Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">La-la-la-la</p><p ttm:agent="v1">La-la-la-la</p><p ttm:agent="v1">La-la-la-la</p><p ttm:agent="v1">La-la-la-la</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(La-la-la-la) It's outrageous, I'll just say it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(La-la-la-la) She's a t-t-t-t-t-temptation</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(La-la-la-la) It's contagious, can't contain this</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(La-la-la-la) She's a t-t-t-t-t-temptation</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I can't pretend I've never thought about it (About it)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I've been steering clear of your surroundings</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I know the guy that you've been going out with</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I guess that we'll just have to work around him</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But fuck if he knows</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I want you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I bet you're taking me home</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm onto you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(La-la-la-la) It's outrageous, I'll just say it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(La-la-la-la) She's a t-t-t-t-t-temptation</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(La-la-la-la) It's contagious, can't contain this</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(La-la-la-la) She's a t-t-t-t-t-temptation[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Oh) Babe, I know I'm your type</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Me and your ex look alike, but</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm the one you'll keep (Keep)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You scare the shit outta me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, how you get what you please</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, yеah (So, so)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But fuck if he knows (But fuck if he knows)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I want you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I bеt you're taking me home</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm onto you (I'm onto you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's outrageous, I'll just say it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(La-la-la-la) She's a t-t-t-t-t-temptation</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Onto you) It's contagious, can't contain this</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(La-la-la-la) She's a t-t-t-t-t-temptation</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Onto you, oh-oh) It's outrageous, I'll just say it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(La-la-la-la) She's a t-t-t-t-t-temptation (Oh-oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(La-la-la-la) It's contagious, can't contain this (Oh-oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(La-la-la-la) She's a t-t-t-t-t-temptation</p></div></body></tt>